FIX: the S-b feeds take an inert watch door, so ONE store write is ONE observation on every platform
(the real watcher stays pinned by the S-c/S-d and raw-write arms).
$ bun test packages/mpd-team-core-plugin/test/change-feed.test.ts    # AFTER
