## The dist fan-out (why 29 targets went stale)
$ bun build mpd-better-sidebar-host … && Compare-Object committed vs fresh
<= import { join, resolve } from "node:path";
=> import { isAbsolute, join, relative, resolve, sep } from "node:path";
